data: {"id": "41e2d3d53d96479f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1358", "run_id": "41e2d3d53d96479f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已根据工具调用结果完成了对 `aiops-case-v09/workload` 的证据采集。以下是关键事实、冲突点和证据缺口：\n\n### 1. 关键事实（支持候选原因：进程异常退出导致 CrashLoopBackOff）\n* **Pod 状态**：`kubectl_get_yaml` 和 `kubectl_describe` 均确认 Pod 处于 `Running` 阶段，但容器 `app` 状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`restarts=5`，`ready=False`。这直接证实了 Pod 未恢复，处于持续重启异常中。\n* **退出原因与代码**：`kubectl_previous_logs` 和 `kubectl_previous_logs_all_containers` 均返回了相同的 Python Traceback。关键证据显示进程在启动时尝试读取文件 `/input/app.conf` 时崩溃：\n  ```text\n  Traceback (most recent call last):\n    ...\n  FileNotFoundError: [Er", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789136198207, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

